<title>UK: St Petersburg sets $300 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg sets $300 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF ST PETERSBURG</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+312.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> IBCA	 BB+	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS UK/RU/US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5 PCT   SELL CONC  0.5 PCT   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT MAY 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
